        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "address, Judaeo-Arabic",
          "value": "<p>Your honor, my sir and master, Sheikh Ab\u016b \u2019l-Faraj son of Ab\u016b \u2019l-Barak\u0101t the doctor who rests in Eden. From his son Joseph\u2014may he have a long life. To the shop of Sheikh Ab\u016b \u2019l-Faraj al-Shar\u0101bi\u0304.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
