          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "address, Arabic",
          "value": "<p>To Fust\u0101t, to the Great Market, to be given to Sheikh Ab\u016b \u2019l-Faraj the doctor, the brother of Sheikh Ab\u016b \u2019l-\u1e24asan, from his son Y\u016bsuf. Deliver this and then you will receive your payment.</p>",
